{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_01_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_01",
  "title": "艾伦精选",
  "storyCode": "MN-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "105d45c8fdb65e3ba9c5612cebc851a59f0367725281d8ba77165fc70c8ce55f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 1下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_nearllivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（装备，穿戴完毕。剑......是姐姐以前的训练剑，应该还能用吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（就这样出发......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......玛恩纳叔叔....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，还嫌临光家不够丢人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士竞技......部门的同事已经告诉我这件事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不配站上骑士竞技的赛场，而骑士竞技也配不上临光之名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是佐菲娅怂恿的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的！是我自愿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想也是。佐菲娅虽然只是临光家的陪侍，但好歹也在那种商业闹剧里占有一席之地......她现在也是“骑士阶级”了，呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我只是想保护......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算被剥夺了贵族身份，我们的信条也不会有一丝动摇，没有什么需要被保护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更没有什么需要你保护，玛莉娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别和玛嘉烈一样，只因为年轻气盛就轻易打破了那份矜持——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——部长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好，嗯，是的，是我没错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请阁下务必放心，如果您对先前的会议有任何疑问都可以来找我......什么？不，不，请您再考虑一下......求您了，是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛恩纳瞥了一眼玛莉娅，他冷漠地走上楼去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，的确是我的工作失误，与阁下无关，稍后我会将修订过的文档邮寄给您......明天，对，明天一定......非常抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，恳求您务必再考虑一下。嗯，一定，是的，我不会再犯这种失误，请原谅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——玛莉娅，下次再说回你的事情，希望你自己有点分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......现在动摇有什么用，快要赶不上和佐菲娅约定的时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站稳了，注意节奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十分钟，一次反击都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......说是单手对付我，你的那把剑不就是单手用的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全力以赴的话另一只手也不会闲着的，想试试莱塔尼亚人的作战方法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是听说过各国的骑士有着迥异的风格......但佐菲娅姐姐连那种都可以做到的！？欺负人吧！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照葫芦画瓢罢了，我也不是什么都没准备就打输了那场比赛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑母......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，已经过去那么长时间了，我也不是特别在意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是你啊......现在你这个水平，上了赛场真的只是炮灰而已喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，继续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的，但是能再等半分钟吗，我的腿在打颤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这都坚持不下来的话，那劝你放弃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！好，来吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈......怎、怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么怎么样......你站都站不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了睡觉和吃饭......基本......一直在运动啊，佐菲娅姐姐......你就一点不累吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你知道团体混战赛吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士竞技中最有看点的赛制，每个骑士团派出一名代表，不过你的情况属于独立参赛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后在十人到数十人不等的巨大人造赛场上，以命中盔甲的次数判定分数，最后转换成竞赛积分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然了......如果在时限结束前被击倒或是失去作战能力则是直接出局，分数归零。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这、这我还是知道的啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。那你知道一场混战赛的时长会有多久吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......几个小时？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "历史上最长的一次团体混战，狂热的观众和企业一次次加时下，持续了一天一夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士们就像是被赶进笼子的钳兽，被迫一次次重整旗鼓，互相战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一天一夜，出局的人全都一无所获，负伤惨重，但留到最后的三个人一举得到了正赛的入场资格，足够多的积分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这样......欸，一整天的战斗只有三个人能顺利晋级吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自从第一个赛区赞助商推出这种模式之后，效仿的商家就比源石虫还快地冒了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么说呢......虽然吃相难看，但可悲的是，观众喜欢，那也就无论结果如何了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你起码做好打上一天一夜也不会累的准备！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——一天一夜！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天就到这里结束吧，有点进步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "运动结束之后不要立刻躺下，起来走两步，想想晚上吃什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好吧，唔！腿好酸......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然了，你的步调实在太不像样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竞速赛......就不指望了，只要那些出名的骑士团里还有那么几个专精竞速赛的选手，我们就没什么希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但就算这样，在人造地形中的机动性也是很重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然......因为竞速赛本质也是依赖装备的赛制，除了体能之外，我们也没有那么多资金折腾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——！我想到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次修点唱机的时候，马丁叔送了我两张餐厅优惠券来着，我们去那里吃晚饭吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，别急着生气呀，我只是想犒劳一下佐菲娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没生气，那我们什么时候出发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然难得一起出去吃饭......起码换身衣服洗个澡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......不过吃完饭回来还是要继续的，别太松懈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（玛莉娅的进步很明显。我还以为她只不过是一时冲动.....）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她真的是认真的......比她表现出来的还要认真。毕竟我都觉得这种训练强度过而不及......本来想着让她放弃来着。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拼命到这个地步还保持着平时那副乐天派的态度......也不知道和谁学的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这算是斗志吗......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佐菲娅抬起头，杂草丛生的花园极远处，高楼广厦，灯火辉煌。\n像是要欺骗自己一样，她悄悄用从未使用过的那只手抚上剑柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在剑刃出鞘之前，肌肉的剧痛从腰部传递到手臂，意料之中，在失去知觉前，她放下了手。\n三周后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两丫头多久没出现了？明明可以在休息时间去酒吧坐坐的，这么见外干嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，“闭门修炼”在今天的年轻人之间也很流行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哪个年代流行过？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我年轻那会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士不都是云游四方锻炼自己的，哪有闭门修行过？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁，雇得起天灾信使又有移动手段的骑士老爷们哪懂人间疾苦......为了给你搞把好剑差点没累死在工坊里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘟囔啥呢，要骂就骂，别阴阳怪气的，吵架我怕过你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还真当自己还是那个骑士老爷了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......听见了没......是丫头们练剑的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没聋！嗯，不错，市面上的训练剑都太轻了，那些垃圾厂商还喜欢偷工减料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这两把的声音很悦耳，啊，应该说相当不错......可我怎么好像听过这把剑的声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为你老了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我懒得和你贫，赶紧的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不是迷路了吧？老糊涂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "急什么！？佐菲娅的花园这么大——我们应该问门口的仆人要台摩托车的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩托车有啥用，佐菲娅家的杂草比临湖河畔的森林还他娘的茂盛，你往哪儿开？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔哦——差点绊着我......这是啥？引擎盖？在花园里的引擎盖？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意脚步！调整呼吸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯......基本功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这都一个月了还在扎实基本功，看来要错过不少积分喏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......科瓦尔，你是不是真的老糊涂了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "练了一个月基本功是没错，但玛莉娅怎么也是临光家的小女儿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得老天马和玛嘉烈还在的时候，她没有练过这些“基本功”吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么擅长领域，什么身价排名，吃饱了撑的才折腾那些玩意——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——真正的卡西米尔骑士就该这样，精进武艺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼啊......呼啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要停下来，势头不错，继续！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......真的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嘛是嘛，那就做好在床上躺三天的准备吧——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（口哨）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯，这一剑还是有点意思的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反手剑，非常快，而且直取要害。这是特训的成果吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你什么时候来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，不过眼前这光景，倒是让我想起玛嘉烈还在的时候啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？啊？好像习惯性的就......我怎么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......你的剑呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被、被你打飞了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸！？我！?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少得意！只是我一时不忍心被你钻了空子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。原来佐菲娅还是会有不忍心的时候啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行啦，我答应你，好吧，参加骑士竞技。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我要作为教练全程陪同，你对骑士竞技基本就是一知半解......赛程安排，积分获取，情报分析，我们还有很多——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——别躺下！起来！我们还要好多事情要准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸、欸.......就稍微，休息一会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别睡啊......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
